---
// Architecture component - School LAN topology for Talisay Integrated School
---

<section id="architecture" class="relative bg-[#09110c] py-24 border-t border-[#1f3627] text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#2a4c37] bg-[#112017] px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#4ade80]">
        <img src="/tis_logo.png" alt="TIS Logo" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 object-contain" />
        <span>Campus Network Topology</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Designed for Talisay Integrated School LAN & offline resilience.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
        TIS RMS runs directly on a local school server in Tiaong, Quezon — teachers never have to pause work when local internet is slow or interrupted.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Tier Architecture Diagram Visual -->
    <div class="mt-16 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#0c1610] p-6 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-2xl">
      
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1f3627] pb-5">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Full-Stack Campus Topology</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Talisay Integrated School Local Network Architecture</p>
        </div>
        <span class="rounded-lg bg-[#16a34a]/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-[#4ade80] font-semibold border border-[#16a34a]/30">
          Campus LAN Mode (Offline-First)
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        
        <!-- Tier 1: Clients -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017]/90 p-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="rounded-md bg-blue-500/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/25">
                Teacher Terminals
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Flutter SDK</span>
            </div>

            <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Teacher & Staff Clients</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">Fast native UI for faculty desks and mobile scanning.</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3.5">
                <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400">
                  <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Windows Desktop App</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Class Advisers & Registrar Desks</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3.5">
                <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#16a34a]/20 text-[#4ade80]">
                  <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Android Mobile App</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">MLKit Camera Document Scanner</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <span>HTTP / REST Campus API</span>
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-[#4ade80] animate-pulse" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2: Backend Server & DB -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#16a34a]/50 bg-[#09110c] p-6 glow-emerald">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="rounded-md bg-[#16a34a]/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#4ade80] border border-[#16a34a]/40">
                School Server Core
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4ade80] font-mono">Express 5.2</span>
            </div>

            <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Node.js Express & SQLite</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">Local server REST API with SQLite (`tis_rms.db`) persistence.</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017] p-3.5">
                <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#16a34a]/20 text-[#4ade80]">
                  <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">`better-sqlite3` DB</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Zero-maintenance local file storage</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017] p-3.5">
                <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400">
                  <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Windows Service Server</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Runs 24/7 on designated school PC</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <span>Local Processing Pipeline</span>
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-[#4ade80] animate-pulse" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3: OCR & Report Generators -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017]/90 p-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="rounded-md bg-amber-500/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30">
                Processing Engines
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">DepEd Suite</span>
            </div>

            <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">OCR & Document Engine</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">Ghostscript PDF rasterizer, Tesseract OCR & ExcelJS.</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3.5">
                <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-600/20 text-[#4ade80]">
                  <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Tesseract OCR Engine</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Automated text & field extraction</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3.5">
                <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400">
                  <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">ExcelJS SF-10 Processor</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">DepEd JHS & SHS template engine</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-[#4ade80] font-mono">
            ✓ Bundled Binaries & Local Processing
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Why School LAN Architecture? Grid -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/80 p-6 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#15271d]">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#16a34a]/20 text-[#4ade80] font-bold border border-[#16a34a]/30">
          1
        </div>
        <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Zero Internet Dependency</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Faculty and advisers at Talisay Integrated School can run daily enrollment, document uploads, and report generation seamlessly over local Wi-Fi / Ethernet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/80 p-6 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#15271d]">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#f59e0b]/20 text-amber-400 font-bold border border-[#f59e0b]/30">
          2
        </div>
        <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Student Data Privacy</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Learner records, PSA birth certificates, and academic histories remain safely within Talisay school hardware with no public cloud risks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/80 p-6 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#15271d]">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#16a34a]/20 text-[#4ade80] font-bold border border-[#16a34a]/30">
          3
        </div>
        <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Lightning Fast LAN Speed</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Local SQLite operations (`better-sqlite3`) ensure instantaneous PDF previews, student directory lookups, and report generation across campus rooms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
